<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sonoco Products raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sonoco Products raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it upgraded Sonoco Products Co to buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Joel Tiss said the shares have fallen from the low $30s to $26 but earnings should begin growing again as early as the second quarter, according to a Lehman report.</p>
<p>-- The analyst raised his 12- to 18-month price target on the stock to $35 from $32.</p>
<p>-- The stock was flat at 27.</p>
</text>
